  "sourceTitle": "Introducing the LiveCodeBench Leaderboard - Holistic and Contamination-Free Evaluation of Code LLMs",
  "sourceBodyHash": "54977b3c2fecf87b5afec0893a4353ddbe1286cde729b680bc2f9d153e888bfb",
